OL,3,GNEWSATenant called a tramp by housing
OL,4,Afirm worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FA social housing tenant called a
OL,7,F"tramp" by a worker from his home's
OL,8,Fmanagement company, who used an
OL,9,Fexpletive with the slur, said it left
OL,10,Fhim feeling worthless and "like scum".
OL,12,FThe customer, who the BBC has agreed
OL,13,Fnot to name to protect his daughter's
OL,14,Fidentity, said the insult was the final
OL,15,Fstraw after months of reporting mould
OL,16,Fin his home to the company.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
