OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATenant called a tramp by housing
OL,4,Afirm worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeyond Housing, which runs 15,000
OL,7,Fproperties across the Tees Valley and
OL,8,FNorth Yorkshire, some rented to people
OL,9,Fon low incomes or benefits, said it had
OL,10,Fapologised profusely to the customer
OL,11,F"for the totally unacceptable
OL,12,Fbehaviour".
OL,14,FHenry - not his real name - said his
OL,15,Fliving situation pushed him to
OL,16,F"breaking point".
